The formula Prop at line 6, col 9 to line 6, col 14 of module ErPropActionPlain is an action-level formula (i.e., it contains no temporal operators). Only temporal-level (or state-level) formulas are allowed under PROPERTY or PROPERTIES. To check that action Prop holds in *every* step of the behavior, define a temporal property: Let A be the formula at line 6, col 9 to line 6, col 14 of module ErPropActionPlain; rewrite A as [][A]_v, where v is a state function (typically the tuple of variables) (compare page 90 of Specifying Systems at https://lamport.azurewebsites.net/tla/book.html).
